{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1133","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Preparation for International Women's Day"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"International Women's Day is coming soon! Polycarp is preparing for the holiday."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ candy boxes in the shop for sale. The $$$i$$$-th box contains $$$d_i$$$ candies."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarp wants to prepare the maximum number of gifts for $$$k$$$ girls. Each gift will consist of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly two"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" boxes. The girls should be able to share each gift equally, so the total amount of candies in a gift (in a pair of boxes) should be divisible by $$$k$$$. In other words, two boxes $$$i$$$ and $$$j$$$ ($$$i \\ne j$$$) can be combined as a gift if $$$d_i + d_j$$$ is divisible by $$$k$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"How many boxes will Polycarp be able to give? Of course, each box can be a part of no more than one gift. Polycarp cannot use boxes \"partially\" or redistribute candies between them. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5, 1 \\le k \\le 100$$$) — the number the boxes and the number the girls."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le d_i \\le 10^9$$$), where $$$d_i$$$ is the number of candies in the $$$i$$$-th box."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the maximum number of the boxes Polycarp can give as gifts."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 2\n1 2 2 3 2 4 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8 2\n1 2 2 3 2 4 6 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 3\n1 2 2 3 2 4 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Polycarp can give the following pairs of boxes (pairs are presented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"indices of corresponding boxes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"): "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(2, 3)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(5, 6)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(1, 4)$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So the answer is $$$6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example Polycarp can give the following pairs of boxes (pairs are presented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"indices of corresponding boxes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"): "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(6, 8)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(2, 3)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(1, 4)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(5, 7)$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So the answer is $$$8$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example Polycarp can give the following pairs of boxes (pairs are presented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"indices of corresponding boxes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"): "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(1, 2)$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$(6, 7)$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So the answer is $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1133B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1133/problem/B"}